  ports firewalld-no-ss ----------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. The firewalld host without ss$
# (iproute): the Ports section is one row that says so.$
$
# Firewall Configuration #######################################$
$
  [+] Firewall             Configured firewalld running$
$
  firewalld ----------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Installed            Yes$
  [+] Running              Yes$
  [+] At boot              Yes$
   -  Default zone         public$
   -  Active zones         internal, public$
$
  Ports --------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [?] Listening ports      ss not installed$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Disable firewalld    Stop firewalld (not recommended)$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

